    "id": "notification-list-mixed-9299",
    "source": "<b>Bernardo:</b> <indent=16%>Right, my lord.</indent>\n<b>Queen Gertrude</b>, <b>Polonius</b>, and <b>King Claudius</b> now believe that Hamlet believes that \"Fortinbras will cross Denmark\".\n<b>Polonius:</b> <indent=16%>My King, I also have a grievance!",
    "target": "<b>贝尔纳多:</b> <indent=16%>是，陛下。</indent>\n<b>乔特鲁德王后</b>、<b>波洛涅斯</b>和<b>克劳狄斯国王</b>现在认为，哈姆雷特相信“福丁布拉斯将穿越丹麦”。\n<b>波洛涅斯:</b> <indent=16%>陛下，我也有件不满的事要说！",
